Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_dirread.c
Line: 5654
Function: EstimateStripByteCounts
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: When td->td_planarconfig == PLANARCONFIG_SEPARATE, the code divides 'space' by td->td_samplesperpixel without validating it is non-zero. A malformed TIFF with SamplesPerPixel set to 0 will trigger a division by zero.

Source context:
```c
